- The integer array parameter `arr` must not be null.
- The integer result is the largest product of a contiguous non-empty subarray within the integer array parameter `arr`.
- The integer result is guaranteed to fit in a 32-bit integer.
- The length of the integer array parameter `arr` is greater than or equal to 1 and is less than or equal to 20000.
- All values in the integer array parameter `arr` are greater than or equal to -10 and are less than or equal to 10.